></div><p class="text-sm @sm:text-base font-[450] leading-[1.2] text-pretty text-[color:var(--section-text-secondary)]">Note: this is not an announcement of an additional incident.<br/><br/>There is no change since our last update. New signups remain paused while we prioritize reliability for existing customers during recovery. We do not have a date to share yet for re-enabling signups.<br/><br/>The latest information remains in our addendum at <a href="https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident#continuous-updates" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline">https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident#continuous-updates</a>.<!-- --> We will post our next update around 15:00 UTC on October 27.</p></div><span class="inline-flex w-fit text-xs @sm:text-sm leading-[1.2] text-[color:var(--section-text-secondary)] opacity-70" style="cursor:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2016%2016%22%20width%3D%2220%22%20height%3D%2220%22%20shape-rendering%3D%22crispEdges%22%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22white%22%20d%3D%22M2%2C4h6v1h-6zM1%2C5h4v1h-4zM6%2C5h3v1h-3zM1%2C6h4v1h-4zM6%2C6h3v1h-3zM1%2C7h4v1h-4zM6%2C7h3v1h-3zM1%2C8h2v1h-2zM6%2C8h3v1h-3zM1%2C9h8v1h-8zM1%2C10h8v1h-8zM2%2C11h6v1h-6z%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22black%22%20d%3D%22M2%2C0h6v4h-6zM1%2C4h1v1h-1zM8%2C4h1v1h-1zM0%2C5h1v5h-1zM5%2C5h1v3h-1zM9%2C5h1v6h-1zM0%2C10h1v1h-1zM9%2C7h2v2h-2zM3%2C8h3v1h-3zM1%2C11h1v1h-1zM8%2C11h1v1h-1zM2%2C12h6v4h-6z%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E&quot;) 10 10, default">October 27, 03:22 UTC</span></div></div><div class="-mx-2 mt-1 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--section-text-secondary)] opacity-70">Earlier updates</span><div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[color:var(--section-text-secondary)] opacity-15"></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-stretch"><div class="w-0.5 rounded-full" style="background:var(--section-status-line);opacity:1"></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm @sm:text-base font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[color:var(--section-text-primary)]">Monitoring</span></div><p class="text-sm @sm:text-base font-[450] leading-[1.2] text-pretty text-[color:var(--section-text-secondary)]">Note: this is not an announcement of an additional incident.<br/><br/>As we work to recover all of our systems after the October 21 Security Incident (<a href="https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline">https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident</a>), we will be using this Status Page incident to provide updated information.<br/><br/>If you subscribe at the top of page at status.railway.com, you can get new updates as they are posted. We expect to post at least twice a day during the week until all parts of Railway are fully operational or if we decide on an alternate channel for such communication.<br/><br/>We have updated our original post with an addendum at <a href="https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident#continuous-updates" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline">https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident#continuous-updates</a>,<!-- --> and will notify you here of any additional addendums.</p></div><span class="inline-flex w-fit text-xs @sm:text-sm leading-[1.2] text-[color:var(--section-text-secondary)] opacity-70" style="cursor:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2016%2016%22%20width%3D%2220%22%20height%3D%2220%22%20shape-rendering%3D%22crispEdges%22%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22white%22%20d%3D%22M2%2C4h6v1h-6zM1%2C5h4v1h-4zM6%2C5h3v1h-3zM1%2C6h4v1h-4zM6%2C6h3v1h-3zM1%2C7h4v1h-4zM6%2C7h3v1h-3zM1%2C8h2v1h-2zM6%2C8h3v1h-3zM1%2C9h8v1h-8zM1%2C10h8v1h-8zM2%2C11h6v1h-6z%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22black%22%20d%3D%22M2%2C0h6v4h-6zM1%2C4h1v1h-1zM8%2C4h1v1h-1zM0%2C5h1v5h-1zM5%2C5h1v3h-1zM9%2C5h1v6h-1zM0%2C10h1v1h-1zM9%2C7h2v2h-2zM3%2C8h3v1h-3zM1%2C11h1v1h-1zM8%2C11h1v1h-1zM2%2C12h6v4h-6z%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E&quot;) 10 10, default">October 26, 19:12 UTC</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-0.5 w-full rounded-full bg-border-subtle"></div><div data-severity="default" class="overflow-clip rounded-t-xl transition-[border-radius] duration-300 rounded-b-[20px]" style="background:var(--section-background);box-shadow:var(--section-card-shadow)"><div class="relative z-20 flex w-full cursor-pointer select-none gap-2 @min-[600px]:gap-3 items-start overflow-clip rounded-xl p-3 @min-[600px]:p-4" style="background:var(--section-header-background);box-shadow:var(--section-card-shadow)"><div class="shrink-0 p-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="text-[color:var(--section-header-text-primary)] transition-transform "><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm @min-[600px]:text-base font-[550] leading-[1.2] text-[color:var(--section-header-text-primary)]">Railway</span><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="hidden @min-[400px]:block shrink-0 overflow-clip" aria-hidden="true" style="max-width:0;opacity:0;margin-right:-8px;transition:max-width 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1), opacity 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1), margin-right 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1), mask-size 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1), -webkit-mask-size 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);mask-image:linear-gradient(to right, #000 0